<title>Ethiopia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/ethiopia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-ethiopia-2026-11-02T00:56:13.442Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:56:13 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Prime Minister Abiy Ahmed is sending senior ministers to military training in Hurso while Ethiopian drones strike targets in Sudan, an Amhara displacement camp and civilians gathering grain in Tigray. Sudan accuses Ethiopia of using Assosa Airport as a launch base for RSF drones and supplying arms to the RSF. Fighting groups fired an RPG near a school in Moyale and killed 60 Ethiopian Orthodox believers, prompting the Orthodox Church to demand action. Nearly 50,000 Ethiopians are fleeing the Moyale conflict into Kenya, where the Kenya Red Cross and UN are registering arrivals. 2,824 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTFA1LVJRU1FVNjJwb1g1TFM3bzYwOFlEVkYyWFF5UGx4aDlXQ1pZSHI2VWpucmFuT2tTeWg3MUdvajR1aGxUN1FrSUlJMC1sUlVUR1RoUXFFdGdEaWNDX1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOR2RXbGFHYTlkMXR4Wmo1NTBNQ0lIWXZIMFlBcVB5bGhNS2pjM2hwN0RhdzRsbGR2YWdWX1ZCbEhVMnB2QkFNZ0MxdGRQRUFaWDdTV0hCWUdIV2NwSGhGTE8tV29nU28zcmJzMmNJMjFQdWJsQUZzb3BKb0J1dFlDSDVZRHhDYVhyZkdDeHRGTGpxeXlfSHU3bkIyTEg5YS1SOU10T0JMdnRfUmdMdW4zaDhWQXc?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVkFVX3lxTFAweFZQc3p4OHFNZVBaUXBSQXl1ZW0tcERhclN2T3JTbFZQSDBpMmgza21lWE9KLThjSkY2SE5RQ3ZleUpudU56cnYwdGthSDJJRERiVDZB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ynetnews&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxPTXJuUFVpQk5NTVJaRUlhU2lJWFp5ZXBrZHllczJ1N29DTzBza2UyTVd6Z1U3d3dRTFRnUjdZeTc3ZTd1WFFELWI5TWNXODNMMlBsOTdaSXl4UWpHQ29kNk4wYTRMeUtqNlczSlZzTGJ4QU1TLU9sNjU3QmtsOTRCY1lUa0ZyQlVORjRXeFZUYWdyRnFDanBpYmxOcU5hSW9zS1p0SmR5dWx6ZlU?oc=5&quot;&gt;Arab News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://